## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 3 Pro Preview (High)
- **Short description:** Google's pro-tier preview model with strong reasoning and multimodal capabilities, superseded by 3.1 Pro.
- **Provider / access:** Google Gemini API (`gemini-3-pro`), Vertex AI. Chat Completions API.
- **Release / knowledge:** November 18, 2025 release (legacy). Knowledge cutoff: January 1, 2025.
- **IDs:** `gemini-3-pro` (Gemini API), `google/gemini-3-pro` (Vertex AI)
- **Context window:** 1M tokens (≈1500 A4 pages). Verified via Artificial Analysis.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, speech, and video input; text output. Reasoning enabled. Tool calling supported. JSON mode available.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10):** $2.00/M input tokens, $12.00/M output tokens. Cache discount: 90%. Moderate pricing. Free tiers may be available via Google Cloud Vertex AI.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary. Pro models typically 80-200B parameters. Uses extended thinking/reasoning.

