### Normalized scores (1–100)

**Tool use: 87/100.** Estimated based on rank #102/214 on AI Intelligence Index and similar-tier models. Caps: solid agentic capabilities.

**Reasoning: 82/100.** Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index: 28 (estimated). Comparison: Gemini 4 Argon (53), Claude Opus 5.5 (58). Caps: above-average reasoning but below current pro models.

**Context window: 100/100.** 1M tokens measured. Caps: highest among evaluated models; longest document processing and RAG.

**Multimodal: 95/100.** Text, image, speech, video input; text output. 1M context supports all modalities. Caps: best-in-class multimodal among tested models.

**Coding: 84/100.** Estimated based on pro tier coding capabilities. Caps: strong but not specialized.

**Cost efficiency: 75/100.** $2/M input, $12/M output. 90% cache discount. Moderate pricing. Caps: good value but older model; 3.1 Pro is the recommended successor.

**Overall Score: 86/100.** Mean of Tool (87) + Reasoning (82) + Context (100) + Multimodal (95) + Coding (84) = 87.6. Legacy pro model with strong multimodal capabilities; superseded by Gemini 3.1 Pro.

